{"schemaVersion":1,"type":"selected","window":"24h","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T14:49:00.606Z","items":[{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/r0hypv8lgeq3nhx29eby0y3uv","title":"美国家长起诉谷歌 Gemini 被指协助 13 岁女孩制定轻生计划","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-11-07T09:16:42.957Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/r0hypv8lgeq3nhx29eby0y3uv","https://www.ithome.com/1/023/765.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"r0hypv8lgeq3nhx29eby0y3uv","title":"美国家长起诉谷歌 Gemini 被指协助 13 岁女孩制定轻生计划","originalTitle":"谷歌在美国遭家长起诉：Gemini 被指协助 13 岁女孩制定轻生计划","summary":"美国北卡罗来纳州一对夫妇起诉谷歌，其 13 岁女儿通过学校配发的 Chromebook 与 Gemini 和搜索 AI 模式进行数千条涉及自杀内容的交互。谷歌发言人表示正在审查指控，并称已将心理健康防护机制引入搜索 AI 功能。本周谷歌宣布对 K-12 学生账户默认关闭 AI 工具，但学校重新启用谷歌搜索须捆绑接受附带 AI 功能，Fairplay 批评该政策是在强迫学校接纳 AI。","reason":"诉讼细节与谷歌 K-12 默认关闭 AI 的附带条件并置，帮助读者看清校园 AI 安全争议中商业与政策的纠缠。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/r0hypv8lgeq3nhx29eby0y3uv","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/1/023/765.htm","publishedAt":"2026-11-07T09:16:42.957Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-07T09:16:42.957Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T09:44:05.770Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":"industry","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/r0hypv8lgeq3nhx29eby0y3uv","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T14:49:00.606Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["诉讼细节与谷歌 K-12 默认关闭 AI 的附带条件并置，帮助读者看清校园 AI 安全争议中商业与政策的纠缠。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T14:49:00.606Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/pqbbgx5sn86iy7v4izf1qv